# Enforce LF line endings repo-wide so the freeze-manifest (ARK-NG-002) hashes
# the SAME bytes on every platform. Without this, Windows checkouts (autocrlf)
# produce CRLF working-tree bytes while Linux CI checks out LF -> SHA/byte
# mismatch -> NEG.ARCHIVE.MANIFEST_MISMATCH. Determinism is load-bearing here.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary types: never normalize (no files of these tracked today; defensive for
# future additions so a binary blob is never CRLF/LF-mangled).
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.gz   binary
*.zip  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.so   binary
*.dll  binary
